        "perks": {
          "type": "perks",
          "settings": {
            "icon_1": "shopify://shop_images/2_1.png",
            "text_1": "Fast Free Shipping in 2–5 Days",
            "detail_1": "<p>We offer <strong>free shipping</strong> on all orders to the contiguous 48 states in the United States.</p><ul><li>Processing time: 1–3 business days</li><li>Shipping time: usually 2–5 business days (depending on your location)</li><li>Carriers: UPS / FedEx</li></ul><p><strong>Note:</strong><br/>We currently do not ship to Alaska, Hawaii, Puerto Rico, PO Boxes, or APO/FPO addresses.<br/>You will receive a tracking number once your order ships.<a href=\"/pages/shipping-policy\" title=\"Shipping Policy\"> More</a></p>",
            "icon_2": "shopify://shop_images/2_3.png",
            "text_2": "30-Day Free Returns",
            "detail_2": "<p>We offer a <strong>30-day free return policy</strong>.</p><ul><li>You may return the bike within 30 days of delivery if it is in new, unused condition with original packaging.</li><li>To start a return, please email us at <a href=\"mailto:support@aotos.com\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>support@aotos.com</strong></a> with your order number and photos/videos if needed.</li><li>We will review your request within 3 business days.</li></ul><p><strong>Return shipping:</strong></p><ul><li>If the return is due to our error (wrong item, quality issue, etc.), we cover the return shipping cost.</li><li>If the return is due to change of mind, the customer is responsible for return shipping.</li><li>No restocking fee will be charged.</li></ul><p>   <a href=\"/pages/return-refund-policy\" title=\"Return & Refund Policy\">  More</a></p>",
            "icon_3": "shopify://shop_images/2_923b391a-8035-4372-a1e6-b88e92751e4f.png",
            "text_3": "1-Year Warranty",
            "detail_3": "<p>Your FLUX T26 is covered by our limited warranty:</p><ul><li><strong>Main Components</strong> (Frame, Fork, Handlebar, Motor, Battery, Controller, Display, etc.): <strong>1 Year</strong></li><li><strong>Main Accessories</strong> (Throttle, Lights, Brake Levers, Charger, Shock Absorber, etc.): <strong>6 Months</strong></li><li><strong>Wear & Tear Parts</strong> (Tires, Fenders, Seat, Foot Pegs, Plastic Parts, etc.): <strong>3 Months</strong></li></ul><p><strong>Battery Note:</strong><br/>Covered for 1 year or 500 charge cycles (whichever comes first), with capacity remaining at least 80% of rated capacity under normal conditions.</p><p>Warranty does not cover damage caused by improper use, accidents, or unauthorized modifications.<a href=\"/pages/warranty-policy\" title=\"Warranty Policy\">More</a></p>",
            "icon_4": "shopify://shop_images/2_2_2393cb17-6719-43ff-821d-2a7ba1d45a5b.png",
            "text_4": "Customer Support",
            "detail_4": "<p>We’re here to help!</p><ul><li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:support@aotos.com\" target=\"_blank\">support@aotos.com</a></li><li><strong>Hours:</strong> 10:00 AM–8:30 PM (HKT)</li></ul><p>For the fastest response, please include your order number when contacting us.<br/>Our team typically replies within 1 business day.</p>"
          }
        },
